{"id":"wb-4-129","name":"历代帝王庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"历代帝王庙","text":"历代帝王庙位于北京市西城区新街口街道阜成门内大街131号，是明朝、清朝皇家祭祀三皇五帝和历代贤明帝王的场所。\n祭祀的188位历代帝王从中国460多位帝王中择优而来，包含汉、女真、蒙古等民族的帝王，乾隆对此帝王谱系评价道：“中华统绪不绝如线。”","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8E%86%E4%BB%A3%E5%B8%9D%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94366247,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94366247","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5af4dd91e4a77bccef18b920.jpg","title":"Temple_of_ancient_monarchs,_Beijing,_China_-_panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Temple_of_ancient_monarchs,_Beijing,_China_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/Temple_of_ancient_monarchs%2C_Beijing%2C_China_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Aaron Zhu","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Temple of ancient monarchs, Beijing, China","width":320,"height":180}}